{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KEA7XaLuSt5L4vse2jrany","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  All 3 claims stand as-is. Story: SICA provides principled tiebreaking (+5-8pp on FOLIO),\n  C0 is a continuous predictor validated across 3 families + 2 reasoning architectures,\n  MaxSAT satisfiability checking is essential (not over-engineering). Hero figure shows\n  clean C0-vs-gap scatter with monotonic trend line (7B→14B→72B + QwQ/DeepSeek cluster at origin).\n  Title stays as-is. Target: EMNLP Main acceptance.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: sica_expanded_14b\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Full-scale evaluation on PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7\n      with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. Maximizes statistical power.\n    expected_results:\n      n_total: 804\n      n_folio: 204\n      n_proofwriter: 600\n      K: 12\n      T: 0.7\n      sica_accuracy_folio: 0.824\n      sc_accuracy_folio: 0.755\n      folio_gap_pp: 6.9\n      sica_accuracy_pw: 0.705\n      sc_accuracy_pw: 0.693\n      pw_gap_pp: 1.2\n      sica_accuracy_combined: 0.735\n      sc_accuracy_combined: 0.709\n      combined_gap_pp: 2.6\n      c0_folio: 0.52\n      c0_pw: 0.44\n      c0_combined: 0.46\n      bootstrap_p_folio: 0.023\n      bootstrap_p_combined: 0.072\n      bootstrap_p_pw: 0.18\n      tiebreak_win_rate_folio: 0.78\n      tiebreak_win_rate_combined: 0.75\n      n_ties_folio: 41\n      n_ties_pw: 88\n      n_ties_combined: 129\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.031\n      wall_time_h: 12.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      D012 60题已显示 FOLIO gap=+6.7pp, combined gap=+3.3pp, C0=53.3%。扩展到 804题时：\n      (1) FOLIO gap 从6.7pp 略回归到6.9pp——204题样本更大更稳定，D012的10题FOLIO偏乐观但大方向对，\n      因为 FOLIO 的 NLI 三分类答案空间天然产生 tie（K=12偶数），SICA 的 MaxSAT 在 tie 上胜率~78%；\n      (2) PW gap 收窄到+1.2pp——PW 是二分类（True/False），tie 频率低于 FOLIO 的三分类，\n      且 PW D5 难度较均匀导致 SC 已经较强，SICA 增益空间有限；\n      (3) Combined gap=+2.6pp 因 PW 占 75% 样本被稀释但仍 >2pp；\n      (4) Bootstrap p_folio=0.023 因 n=204 提供充足统计功效（d012 的 n=10 太小），\n      p_combined=0.072 在 p<0.10 阈值内但因 PW 的低信号稀释不够强；\n      (5) C0 保持在 0.46 附近——14B-Instruct 在 T=0.7 下对逻辑推理任务天然产生多样输出，\n      不像 reasoning model 那样收敛，且 K=12 给予足够采样充分暴露多答案路径。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 14B expanded row (FOLIO 82.4 vs 75.5, PW 70.5 vs 69.3, Combined 73.5 vs 70.9)\"\n      - \"T2: Tiebreak Comparison — expanded data (SICA 78% vs random 50% vs alphabetical ~55% on 129 ties)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.46, gap=+2.6pp) for 14B-expanded, with error bars from bootstrap CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      FOLIO 是主力战场——三分类 NLI 天然高 tie 率让 SICA 的 principled tiebreaking 优势最大化。\n      PW 贡献弱但不拖后腿。p<0.05 on FOLIO 是 Claim 1 的统计支撑锚点。\n      Combined p<0.10 足够让 reviewer 接受\"方向性显著\"。\n\n  - name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      K sensitivity (K=6,8,12,16,20) on D012's 60 questions. 测试 tiebreak 频率与 K 的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      K6_sica_acc: 0.717\n      K6_sc_acc: 0.700\n      K6_gap_pp: 1.7\n      K6_c0: 0.40\n      K6_tie_rate: 0.15\n      K8_sica_acc: 0.733\n      K8_sc_acc: 0.700\n      K8_gap_pp: 3.3\n      K8_c0: 0.47\n      K8_tie_rate: 0.20\n      K12_sica_acc: 0.733\n      K12_sc_acc: 0.700\n      K12_gap_pp: 3.3\n      K12_c0: 0.53\n      K12_tie_rate: 0.25\n      K16_sica_acc: 0.750\n      K16_sc_acc: 0.717\n      K16_gap_pp: 3.3\n      K16_c0: 0.57\n      K16_tie_rate: 0.22\n      K20_sica_acc: 0.750\n      K20_sc_acc: 0.733\n      K20_gap_pp: 1.7\n      K20_c0: 0.58\n      K20_tie_rate: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0 随 K 单调递增——更多采样暴露更多 reasoning path，从 K=6 的 0.40 升到 K=20 的 0.58，\n      但增速递减（marginal path discovery 下降）；\n      (2) Tie rate 呈倒 U 形——K=6 时偶数但候选少 tie 少，K=12 处 tie 最多（三分类 4:4:4 分裂概率最高），\n      K=16/20 时多数更容易形成所以 tie 反而下降；\n      (3) Gap 在 K=8-16 稳定在 ~3.3pp，说明 SICA 增益不是 K 特定值的 artifact；\n      (4) K=6 gap 缩小到 1.7pp 因 tie 太少 SICA 无处发力；\n      (5) K=20 gap 也缩小因更多采样让 SC 本身更稳定（大数定律），tie 减少，\n      但 SC 准确率也上升说明 SC 和 SICA 都受益于更多采样只是 marginal SICA gain 递减。\n      K=12 是 sweet spot——足够多样性产生 tie，又不至于太多采样消除分歧。\n    tables:\n      - \"T3: K Sensitivity — 5 rows showing K vs C0 vs gap vs tie_rate\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F4: K curve — dual Y-axis, left: accuracy (SICA vs SC lines), right: C0 and tie_rate\"\n    analysis: >\n      K=12 作为默认值有合理性。关键 insight 是 gap 在 K=8-16 稳定——\n      SICA 不依赖于精确的 K 选择。F4 图支撑\"robust to hyperparameter\"叙事。\n\n  - name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      在 exp-001 的 804 题扩展数据上重新运行 SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic vs SC-first-seen。\n      CPU-only reanalysis。\n    expected_results:\n      n_ties_total: 129\n      sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.77\n      sc_random_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.50\n      sc_alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.53\n      sc_first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.47\n      sica_vs_random_delta_pp: 27.0\n      sica_vs_alphabetical_delta_pp: 24.0\n      n_ties_folio: 41\n      n_ties_pw: 88\n      sica_tiebreak_acc_folio: 0.80\n      sica_tiebreak_acc_pw: 0.75\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) D012 小样本已显示 SICA tiebreak 80% (4/5)，扩展到 129 ties 后回归到 77%——\n      部分 tie 中约束提取质量不够好导致 MaxSAT 选错，但大部分 tie SICA 的 weighted constraint\n      aggregation 确实选出了更一致的答案；\n      (2) Random 理论值 33-50%（取决于 tie 中候选数），实测约 50% 因多数 tie 是 2-way；\n      (3) Alphabetical 略高于 random (53%) 因 FOLIO 答案空间 {True, False, Unknown} 中\n      'False' 排首位而 False 在 NLI 中确实是常见正确答案（否定推理题比例高）——这是个 artifact；\n      (4) First-seen 略低于 random (47%) 因早期采样路径偏向 less-explored reasoning paths；\n      (5) SICA 在 FOLIO ties 上胜率更高 (80%) 因 FOL 约束在逻辑域提取质量最好，\n      PW ties 上略低 (75%) 因 PW 的 closed-world assumption 偶尔与 LLM 的 open-world reasoning 冲突。\n    tables:\n      - \"T2: Tiebreak Comparison (expanded) — 4 methods × overall/FOLIO/PW\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      SICA tiebreak 77% vs random 50% 是 Claim 1 的最直接证据。\n      差距足够大（+27pp on ties）让 reviewer 无法用\"random tiebreak closes the gap\"反驳。\n\n  - name: sica_7b_scaling\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      测试 weaker model → higher C0 → larger SICA gain。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.683\n      sc_accuracy: 0.617\n      gap_pp: 6.7\n      c0: 0.65\n      bootstrap_p: 0.12\n      folio_sica: 0.733\n      folio_sc: 0.633\n      folio_gap_pp: 10.0\n      pw_sica: 0.650\n      pw_sc: 0.604\n      pw_gap_pp: 4.6\n      n_ties: 21\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.81\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.045\n      wall_time_min: 35\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.65 显著高于 14B 的 0.53——7B 模型能力较弱，对逻辑推理任务的\"信心\"更低，\n      同一问题上更容易产生不同推理路径和不同答案，T=0.7 下 diversity 更高；\n      (2) SC 准确率下降到 61.7%（14B 为 70%）因模型基础能力弱，但 SICA gap 扩大到 +6.7pp\n      因高 C0 意味着更多 tie 和更多 SICA 可以介入的机会；\n      (3) FOLIO gap 高达 +10pp——三分类 + 高 C0 双重放大 tiebreak 优势；\n      (4) Tiebreak 胜率 81% 略高于 14B 的 78%——7B 的错误推理链产生的约束质量虽然绝对值低，\n      但正确链和错误链之间的约束满足度差异反而更大（正确答案的约束更 internally consistent），\n      MaxSAT 更容易区分；\n      (5) Bootstrap p=0.12 因 n=60 太小，但方向性明确——扩展数据后预计 p<0.05；\n      (6) Exclusion rate 略高 (4.5% vs 14B 2.6%) 因 7B 产生更多低质量约束被 MaxSAT 排除。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 7B row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.65, gap=+6.7pp) — 高于 14B 点，支撑 monotonic trend\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: 7B column showing high-C0 / high-gap regime\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B 是 C0-vs-gap monotonic trend 的关键高端数据点。C0=0.65 >> 14B 的 0.46(expanded)\n      且 gap 更大，完美验证 \"weaker model → more diversity → more SICA value\"。\n      Combined with 72B 和 QwQ 数据形成完整 scaling story。\n\n  - name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      QwQ-32B 已有数据 formatted for Operating Regime Analysis section。\n      Data from MVP phase (AIME 22题, PW 16题, FOLIO 10题)。\n    expected_results:\n      c0_aime: 0.0\n      c0_pw: 0.1875\n      c0_folio: 0.0\n      c0_combined: 0.036\n      sica_sc_gap_pp_aime: 0.0\n      sica_sc_gap_pp_pw: 0.0\n      sica_sc_gap_pp_folio: 0.0\n      sica_sc_gap_combined: 0.0\n      n_total: 48\n      regime: degenerate\n      regime_explanation: \"C0<5% → SICA≡SC structurally\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) QwQ-32B 是 reasoning model，内置 chain-of-thought 极长且高度确定性——\n      即使 T=0.7 采样，reasoning chain 的内在逻辑锁定导致最终答案几乎完全一致；\n      (2) AIME C0=0% 因数学域答案唯一且 QwQ 准确率高（~73%），不同采样路径殊途同归；\n      (3) PW C0=18.75% 是唯一非零值——PW 的 closed-world reasoning 有歧义性，\n      少数问题上 QwQ 的推理链出现分歧，但仍远低于 14B-Instruct 的 50%；\n      (4) FOLIO C0=0% 因 QwQ 在 NLI 上也高度自洽；\n      (5) Combined C0=3.6% 远低于 20% threshold → SICA 完全退化为 SC，\n      zero ties → zero tiebreak opportunities → gap=0pp across all domains。\n      这不是 SICA 失败，是 operating regime 边界的 clean demonstration。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — QwQ-32B row (all deltas = 0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.036, gap=0.0) — 紧贴原点，与 instruction models 形成鲜明对比\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: QwQ column showing degenerate regime (C0<5%, gap=0)\"\n    analysis: >\n      QwQ 数据是 negative result 但叙事价值极高——证明 SICA 不是 universally applicable，\n      而是 regime-dependent。Reviewer concern \"why not just use reasoning model\" 的答案：\n      reasoning model 不需要 SICA（已经 self-consistent），instruction model 需要且受益。\n\n  - name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      CPU-only analysis: plot C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models and K values。\n      汇总 exp-001/002/004/005/007/010/011/014 数据。\n    expected_results:\n      n_data_points: 14\n      pearson_r: 0.91\n      spearman_rho: 0.88\n      c0_threshold_for_positive_gap: 0.20\n      linear_fit_slope: 0.12\n      linear_fit_intercept: -2.1\n      r_squared: 0.83\n      models_in_scatter:\n        - \"7B (C0=0.65, gap=+6.7)\"\n        - \"14B-expanded (C0=0.46, gap=+2.6)\"\n        - \"72B-AWQ (C0=0.25, gap=+1.0)\"\n        - \"Mistral-7B (C0=0.42, gap=+4.5)\"\n        - \"LLaMA-8B (C0=0.40, gap=+3.8)\"\n        - \"QwQ-32B (C0=0.036, gap=0.0)\"\n        - \"DeepSeek-R1 (C0=0.03, gap=0.0)\"\n        - \"14B K=6 (C0=0.40, gap=+1.7)\"\n        - \"14B K=8 (C0=0.47, gap=+3.3)\"\n        - \"14B K=16 (C0=0.57, gap=+3.3)\"\n        - \"14B K=20 (C0=0.58, gap=+1.7)\"\n      c0_20_binary_classifier_accuracy: 1.0\n      regime_boundary_clean: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) Pearson r=0.91 因 best tier 下所有实验结果都落在预期范围内——高 C0 模型确实产生高 gap，\n      低 C0 模型确实 gap≈0，中间有 smooth gradient；\n      (2) 14 个数据点来自 7 个模型配置 + 5 个 K 值变体 + 2 个 reasoning model，\n      覆盖 C0 从 0.03 到 0.65 的完整 range；\n      (3) C0=0.20 是 clean threshold——所有 C0>0.20 的配置 gap>0，所有 C0<0.20 的 gap≈0，\n      binary classifier accuracy=100%；\n      (4) Slope=0.12 意味着 C0 每增加 10pp SICA gap 增加约 1.2pp——\n      这个关系的物理含义是更多 diversity → 更多 ties → 更多 SICA 纠正机会；\n      (5) R²=0.83 而非 1.0 因 K ablation 数据引入噪声（K=20 gap 回落但 C0 继续升），\n      但仍然是 strong linear trend；\n      (6) Spearman rho=0.88 略低于 Pearson 因 reasoning model 数据点在角落聚集产生 rank tie。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        F2 (Hero Figure): C0-vs-gap scatter plot. X-axis: C0 (0-0.7), Y-axis: SICA-SC gap (pp).\n        Color: model family (Qwen=blue, Mistral=orange, LLaMA=green, reasoning=red).\n        Shape: circle=instruction, triangle=reasoning.\n        Dashed vertical line at C0=0.20 marking regime boundary.\n        Linear fit line with r²=0.83 shown.\n        Shaded region: \"SICA Operating Regime\" for C0>0.20.\n        Key visual: 7B/Mistral/LLaMA cluster in upper-right, 14B in middle, 72B in lower-middle,\n        QwQ+DeepSeek pinned to origin.\n      - >\n        F3: Operating Regime Heatmap. Rows: models (7B, 14B, 72B, Mistral, LLaMA, QwQ, DeepSeek).\n        Columns: domains (FOLIO, PW, GSM8K if available).\n        Cell color: green (C0>0.30, SICA wins), yellow (0.15<C0<0.30, marginal), red (C0<0.10, degenerate).\n        Clean block structure: instruction models green, reasoning models red.\n    analysis: >\n      Hero figure 是论文的 visual thesis statement。R=0.91 的 C0-gap correlation\n      直接支撑 Claim 3 (C0 as practical diagnostic)。Clean threshold at 0.20 让\n      practitioner 可以用 1 次 SC run 的 C0 决定是否部署 SICA——零额外成本。\n      3 family + 2 reasoning architecture coverage 消灭\"family-specific\"攻击。\n\n  - name: sica_72b_awq\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Within-Qwen scaling 高端数据点。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.817\n      sc_accuracy: 0.800\n      gap_pp: 1.7\n      c0: 0.25\n      bootstrap_p: 0.35\n      folio_sica: 0.867\n      folio_sc: 0.833\n      folio_gap_pp: 3.3\n      pw_sica: 0.783\n      pw_sc: 0.775\n      pw_gap_pp: 0.8\n      n_ties: 8\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.75\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.018\n      wall_time_min: 90\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.25 远低于 14B 的 0.53 和 7B 的 0.65——72B 模型能力强，\n      T=0.7 下大多数问题的 12 条采样路径收敛到同一答案，只有最难的题目才出现分歧；\n      (2) SC 准确率 80% 远高于 14B 的 70%——更强的 base model 意味着更高的 ceiling，\n      但这也压缩了 SICA 的改进空间；\n      (3) Gap=+1.7pp 小于 14B 的 +3.3pp——tie 少（8 vs 14B 的 ~16），SICA 介入机会有限，\n      但 tiebreak 胜率仍然 75% 说明 mechanism 有效只是 opportunity 少；\n      (4) FOLIO gap +3.3pp 仍然可观因三分类 tie 概率高于二分类，\n      但 PW gap 几乎消失 (+0.8pp) 因 72B 在 PW 上太强几乎不产生分歧；\n      (5) Bootstrap p=0.35 不显著因 n=60 + low tie count，\n      但这恰好支撑叙事：\"强模型不需要 SICA\"——这是 feature 不是 bug；\n      (6) AWQ 4-bit 量化可能引入微小 noise 增加 C0（相比 FP16 的 72B），\n      但 effect size <2pp，不影响大方向。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 72B-AWQ row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.25, gap=+1.7pp) — 14B 和 QwQ 之间的 bridge point\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B 是 monotonic trend 的关键中间点：7B(0.65, +6.7) > 14B(0.46, +2.6) > 72B(0.25, +1.7) > QwQ(0.04, 0)。\n      完美支撑 \"C0 (reflecting model confidence) determines SICA value\"。\n      虽然 gap 不显著，但在 scatter plot 中的位置 exactly right。\n\n  - name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      Qualitative analysis on 5-10 representative questions from exp-001.\n      检查约束语义质量。\n    expected_results:\n      n_cases: 8\n      semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.85\n      excluded_constraints_are_errors_rate: 0.75\n      case_categories:\n        correct_constraint_correct_answer: 3\n        correct_constraint_wrong_sc_right_sica: 2\n        noisy_constraint_sica_robust: 2\n        bad_constraint_sica_wrong: 1\n      representative_folio_case: >\n        Problem: \"All managers are employees. John is a manager. Is John an employee?\"\n        Trace 1 (correct): extracts ∀x(Manager(x)→Employee(x)), Manager(John) → concludes True\n        Trace 2 (wrong): extracts Manager(John) but misses universal → concludes Unknown\n        MaxSAT: 2 constraints support True, 1 supports Unknown, True wins with higher satisfaction\n      representative_failure_case: >\n        Problem with ambiguous negation: constraint extraction maps \"not all\" incorrectly\n        to ∀x(¬P(x)), leading MaxSAT to select wrong answer\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) 85% semantically meaningful 因 Qwen2.5-14B 的 FOL extraction 能力在 FOLIO 域表现良好——\n      FOLIO 本身是 FOL 标注数据集，问题结构与 LLM 的 FOL 生成训练数据高度匹配；\n      (2) 75% excluded constraints correspond to errors 因 MaxSAT 的 weighted optimization\n      自然地给予 inconsistent constraints 低权重/排除，而 inconsistency 通常来自推理错误；\n      (3) 2/8 cases 展示 SICA 翻转 SC 错误答案——这是 paper 中最有 narrative power 的案例，\n      reviewer 能直观看到 MaxSAT 如何\"看穿\"错误推理链；\n      (4) 1/8 failure case 保持诚实——negation scope ambiguity 是已知的 FOL extraction 弱点，\n      inclusion 增加 credibility。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Figure: 2-3 annotated case study boxes showing constraint extraction → MaxSAT → answer selection pipeline on specific examples\"\n    analysis: >\n      Case studies 支撑 mechanistic understanding——reviewer 需要看到 SICA 不是 black box。\n      Failure case 的 inclusion 是 strategic transparency，预防\"cherry-picking\"攻击。\n\n  - name: overhead_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      Wall-time breakdown per question from exp-001 data。\n      Address \"is the overhead worth it\" concern。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_total_time_per_question_s: 58.0\n      avg_generation_time_s: 42.0\n      avg_constraint_extraction_time_s: 12.5\n      avg_maxsat_solving_time_s: 0.8\n      avg_answer_aggregation_time_s: 2.7\n      generation_fraction: 0.724\n      constraint_extraction_fraction: 0.216\n      maxsat_fraction: 0.014\n      overhead_fraction: 0.276\n      overhead_vs_sc_multiplier: 1.38\n      marginal_cost_per_pp_gain_s: 6.2\n      constraint_extraction_model: \"same 14B (self-extraction)\"\n      maxsat_solver: \"Z3 PB-MaxSAT\"\n      z3_avg_clauses: 145\n      z3_max_solve_time_ms: 320\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) Generation 占 72.4% 因 K=12 条 trace 是主要耗时——这与 SC 完全相同的成本；\n      (2) Constraint extraction 占 21.6%——用同一个 14B 模型做 FOL 提取，每条 trace 一次 forward pass，\n      但 prompt 短（trace + \"extract FOL constraints\"）所以比 generation 快得多；\n      (3) MaxSAT solving 仅占 1.4%——Z3 对 ~145 clauses 的 PB-MaxSAT 平均 <1s，\n      这是 polynomial-time 的 weighted MAX-SAT 不是 NP-hard 的 unweighted 版本；\n      (4) 总 overhead 仅 1.38x SC——generation 成本不变，额外成本全在 extraction，\n      对比 +2.6pp combined gain 这是 acceptable overhead；\n      (5) Marginal cost = 6.2s per pp gain——reviewer 关心的是\"多花的时间值不值\"，\n      这个数字说明每额外一个百分点准确率只需 ~6s 额外计算。\n    tables:\n      - \"T4: Overhead Breakdown — generation/extraction/MaxSAT/total, with fraction and comparison to SC\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart (appendix): time breakdown per stage, colored by generation (grey) / extraction (blue) / MaxSAT (orange)\"\n    analysis: >\n      1.38x overhead 是 strong selling point——不到 40% 额外成本换 2.6pp gain。\n      MaxSAT 1.4% 直接回应\"over-engineering\"concern：solver 本身几乎免费，\n      成本在 extraction 而非 satisfiability checking。\n\n  - name: sica_mistral_7b\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Cross-family validation #1。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.667\n      sc_accuracy: 0.617\n      gap_pp: 5.0\n      c0: 0.42\n      bootstrap_p: 0.17\n      folio_sica: 0.733\n      folio_sc: 0.633\n      folio_gap_pp: 10.0\n      pw_sica: 0.625\n      pw_sc: 0.604\n      pw_gap_pp: 2.1\n      n_ties: 14\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.79\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.038\n      sica_ge_sc: true\n      wall_time_min: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.42 在 [0.30, 0.55] 范围内——Mistral-7B 能力与 Qwen-7B 相近但略弱于 Qwen-14B，\n      在 T=0.7 下产生的 trace diversity 处于中等水平，高于 C0>25% threshold；\n      (2) SC 准确率 61.7% 低于 Qwen-14B 的 70% 但高于纯猜——Mistral-7B 在逻辑推理上\n      不如 Qwen-14B 但仍有一定能力，FOLIO 上更好因 Mistral 的 instruction following 较强；\n      (3) Gap=+5.0pp 高于 14B 的 +3.3pp——C0 更高 + SC baseline 更低 = 更大改进空间，\n      SICA 在更多 tie 中介入且 correctness margin 更大；\n      (4) FOLIO gap +10pp 非常强——三分类 + 中等 C0 + Mistral 在 NLI 上的 inconsistency\n      给 SICA 大量 tiebreak opportunity；\n      (5) Bootstrap p=0.17 因 n=60 不足，但 cross-family replication 的价值不在于单独 significance\n      而在于 pattern consistency——C0>25% 且 SICA≥SC，与 Qwen 家族 pattern 一致；\n      (6) Tiebreak 胜率 79% 与 14B 的 78% 几乎相同——说明 MaxSAT mechanism\n      不是 Qwen-specific（不同 extraction 质量但 relative ranking 仍然有效）。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — Mistral-7B row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.42, gap=+5.0pp) — 落在 trend line 上，non-Qwen validation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-family replication 成功。C0=0.42 且 SICA≥SC 消除\"Qwen-specific\"攻击。\n      如果 p>0.2 但 pattern consistent，在 3-family scatter 中仍然是 strong evidence。\n\n  - name: sica_llama_8b\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Cross-family validation #2。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.650\n      sc_accuracy: 0.600\n      gap_pp: 5.0\n      c0: 0.40\n      bootstrap_p: 0.19\n      folio_sica: 0.700\n      folio_sc: 0.600\n      folio_gap_pp: 10.0\n      pw_sica: 0.617\n      pw_sc: 0.600\n      pw_gap_pp: 1.7\n      n_ties: 13\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.77\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.042\n      sica_ge_sc: true\n      wall_time_min: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.40 在 [0.30, 0.55] 范围内——LLaMA-8B 与 Mistral-7B 同量级模型，\n      trace diversity 相似但 LLaMA 的 instruction following 在逻辑域略弱导致 C0 略低于 Mistral；\n      (2) SC 准确率 60.0% 是所有 instruction model 中最低——LLaMA-3.1-8B 在 FOLIO/PW\n      的逻辑推理上弱于 Mistral-7B（Meta 的 8B 在 NLI 上不如 Mistral 的专项优化），\n      但 SICA 仍然能够 rescue 一些 tie；\n      (3) Gap=+5.0pp 与 Mistral 一致——C0 相近 (0.40 vs 0.42) 导致 SICA gain 几乎相同，\n      这本身就是 C0-as-predictor 的强力证据（不同 family，相似 C0，相似 gain）；\n      (4) FOLIO gap +10pp 因 LLaMA-8B 在三分类 NLI 上最不稳定，tie 比例最高；\n      (5) Tiebreak 胜率 77% 略低于 Mistral/Qwen——LLaMA 的 FOL extraction quality\n      可能略低因训练数据中 formal logic 比例不如 Qwen/Mistral，\n      但 MaxSAT 的 weighted aggregation 仍然足够 robust；\n      (6) Exclusion rate 4.2% 最高——更多低质量约束被排除，但这恰好说明 MaxSAT\n      的 satisfiability checking 在处理 noisy constraints 时的价值。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — LLaMA-8B row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.40, gap=+5.0pp) — 与 Mistral 点紧邻，cross-family cluster\"\n    analysis: >\n      3-family validation complete。Mistral 和 LLaMA 的 (C0, gap) 点紧密聚集在 scatter plot 的\n      同一区域——independent family, similar capacity → similar C0 → similar gain。\n      这是 C0 作为 universal predictor（而非 family-specific artifact）的最直接证据。\n\n  - name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Cross-domain C0 测试。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.900\n      sc_accuracy: 0.900\n      gap_pp: 0.0\n      c0: 0.10\n      bootstrap_p: 1.0\n      n_ties: 1\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.0\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.015\n      wall_time_min: 20\n      avg_constraints_per_problem: 8.5\n      constraint_extraction_note: \"numeric equality constraints less expressive than FOL\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.10 远低于 FOLIO/PW 的 0.46——Qwen2.5-14B 在 GSM8K（小学数学）上准确率极高 (~90%+），\n      12 条采样路径几乎都得到正确数值答案，diversity 极低；\n      (2) SC 准确率 90% 因 14B 对 GSM8K 来说 overqualified——这不是 SICA 失败而是\n      task-relative model confidence 极高的自然结果；\n      (3) Gap=0pp 因 C0=10% < 20% threshold，几乎没有 tie，SICA≡SC；\n      (4) 这个 negative result 极有价值——证明 C0 不只是\"model family\"的函数，\n      而是\"model × task\"交互的函数。同一个 14B 在 FOLIO 上 C0=0.52 在 GSM8K 上 C0=0.10，\n      说明 C0 reflects task-relative difficulty/confidence 而非 model-intrinsic diversity；\n      (5) 约束质量低（avg 8.5 vs FOLIO ~30）——数学域的约束是 numeric equalities\n      而非 FOL predicates，表达力有限且多数 trivially satisfied；\n      (6) 30 题 pilot 足以得出\"C0 low, no gain\"结论，无需扩展。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 14B-GSM8K row (or appendix)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.10, gap=0.0) — near-origin, same model as (0.46, +2.6) FOLIO point\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: GSM8K column for 14B showing yellow/red (C0 low, no gain)\"\n    analysis: >\n      GSM8K pilot 完美验证\"C0 is task-relative, not model-intrinsic\"。\n      Same model (14B), different tasks → dramatically different C0 and correspondingly different gain。\n      这是 Claim 2/3 的 cross-domain evidence。Paper 叙事：\n      \"C0 captures the interaction between model confidence and task difficulty.\"\n\n  - name: constraint_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      CPU-only ablation on exp-001 data: SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight。\n      测试 MAX-SAT 是否 essential。\n    expected_results:\n      n_total: 804\n      sica_maxsat_accuracy: 0.735\n      sica_countonly_accuracy: 0.718\n      sica_randomweight_accuracy: 0.712\n      sc_accuracy: 0.709\n      maxsat_vs_sc_gap_pp: 2.6\n      countonly_vs_sc_gap_pp: 0.9\n      randomweight_vs_sc_gap_pp: 0.3\n      maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp: 1.7\n      maxsat_vs_randomweight_delta_pp: 2.3\n      tie_subset_n: 129\n      maxsat_tiebreak_acc: 0.77\n      countonly_tiebreak_acc: 0.60\n      randomweight_tiebreak_acc: 0.52\n      folio_maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp: 3.4\n      pw_maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp: 0.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) MaxSAT vs count-only delta=+1.7pp（在 [2.0, 5.0] 范围下限附近但仍有意义）——\n      count-only 仅计算每个答案的支持约束数量，忽略约束之间的 satisfiability 关系，\n      MaxSAT 通过 weighted optimization 考虑约束的 mutual consistency 从而更好地区分正确答案；\n      (2) Count-only 仍然比 SC 好 +0.9pp——说明即使不做 satisfiability checking，\n      constraint count 也提供了比 pure vote count 更细粒度的信号（每个 trace 贡献多个约束 vs 1 票），\n      但 marginal gain 远小于 MaxSAT；\n      (3) Random-weight 几乎等于 SC (+0.3pp)——随机权重破坏了约束的 semantic信号，\n      证明 gain 来自有意义的 constraint weighting 而非简单的 multi-signal aggregation；\n      (4) Tiebreak accuracy 差异最明显：MaxSAT 77% vs count-only 60% vs random 52%——\n      tie 是 MaxSAT 与 count-only 差异最大的场景，因为 tie 意味着 vote count 相同，\n      此时 satisfiability structure 成为唯一 differentiator；\n      (5) FOLIO 上 MaxSAT 优势更大 (+3.4pp vs count-only) 因 FOL 约束的 satisfiability\n      在逻辑域更有意义——约束之间的 logical consistency 直接反映推理正确性；\n      (6) PW 上差异较小 (+0.8pp) 因 binary domain 的约束结构较简单，count 已捕获大部分信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Appendix Table: Constraint Ablation — 4 methods × FOLIO/PW/Combined\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy of MaxSAT / count-only / random-weight / SC on combined and per-domain\"\n    analysis: >\n      MaxSAT > count-only > random ≈ SC 的 hierarchy 直接支撑 \"satisfiability checking is essential\"。\n      Tiebreak accuracy 差异 (77% vs 60% vs 52%) 是最 compelling 的数字——\n      在 tie 中 MaxSAT 的 structural reasoning 提供了 count-only 无法匹敌的信号。\n      回应\"over-engineering\"attack：MaxSAT solver 成本 <2% total time 但贡献 +1.7pp over count-only。\n\n  - name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Second reasoning model，LLaMA 底座。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.717\n      sc_accuracy: 0.717\n      gap_pp: 0.0\n      c0: 0.033\n      bootstrap_p: 1.0\n      folio_sica: 0.733\n      folio_sc: 0.733\n      folio_gap_pp: 0.0\n      pw_sica: 0.708\n      pw_sc: 0.708\n      pw_gap_pp: 0.0\n      n_ties: 0\n      multi_candidate_problems: 2\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.008\n      wall_time_min: 45\n      regime: degenerate\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=3.3%（2/60 问题有多答案）在 [0.0, 0.05] 范围内——DeepSeek-R1 虽然是 distilled 到 8B 的\n      小模型，但保留了 reasoning model 的核心特征：extended chain-of-thought 驱动的确定性推理，\n      采样温度 T=0.7 几乎不影响最终答案选择；\n      (2) SC 准确率 71.7% 高于 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 的 60%——R1 distillation 显著提升了\n      推理能力，即使只有 8B 参数也比普通 instruction model 更准确；\n      (3) Gap=0pp 因 C0<5% → SICA≡SC structurally——与 QwQ-32B 的 pattern 完全一致，\n      证明 reasoning model degeneration 不是 Qwen-specific（QwQ 是 Qwen 架构）也不是 size-specific\n      （QwQ 32B vs DeepSeek-R1 8B），而是 reasoning training 的 universal 效应；\n      (4) 仅 2 个问题有多答案且都在 PW 域——与 QwQ 的 pattern 一致（PW 的 closed-world\n      ambiguity 偶尔让 reasoning model 产生分歧，但频率极低）；\n      (5) LLaMA 底座消除\"Qwen 架构归属\"争议——QwQ 和 Qwen-14B 都是 Qwen 架构，\n      reviewer 可能 argue C0 差异来自 architecture 而非 reasoning training；\n      DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B 证明 LLaMA 架构 + reasoning training → low C0，\n      而 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct + no reasoning training → high C0 (0.40)，\n      same architecture, different training → different C0。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B row (all deltas = 0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.033, gap=0.0) — 与 QwQ 紧邻原点，不同架构 same regime\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: DeepSeek-R1 row, all red (degenerate)\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek-R1 是 reasoning model degeneration 的 definitive evidence。\n      与 QwQ 配对：2 reasoning architectures (Qwen-based QwQ + LLaMA-based R1),\n      both show C0<5%, both show SICA≡SC。\n      更强的 controlled comparison: LLaMA-8B-Instruct (C0=0.40) vs DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B (C0=0.033)\n      — same base architecture, only difference is reasoning distillation → proves\n      C0 is determined by training regime, not architecture.\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12918,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12918},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"172f7f56-749b-40ef-a90e-a3bb5aa40d0b","uuid":"1665cc21-62b0-46c8-bfde-40d2c508f270"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":270060,"duration_api_ms":272619,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  All 3 claims stand as-is. Story: SICA provides principled tiebreaking (+5-8pp on FOLIO),\n  C0 is a continuous predictor validated across 3 families + 2 reasoning architectures,\n  MaxSAT satisfiability checking is essential (not over-engineering). Hero figure shows\n  clean C0-vs-gap scatter with monotonic trend line (7B→14B→72B + QwQ/DeepSeek cluster at origin).\n  Title stays as-is. Target: EMNLP Main acceptance.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: sica_expanded_14b\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Full-scale evaluation on PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7\n      with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. Maximizes statistical power.\n    expected_results:\n      n_total: 804\n      n_folio: 204\n      n_proofwriter: 600\n      K: 12\n      T: 0.7\n      sica_accuracy_folio: 0.824\n      sc_accuracy_folio: 0.755\n      folio_gap_pp: 6.9\n      sica_accuracy_pw: 0.705\n      sc_accuracy_pw: 0.693\n      pw_gap_pp: 1.2\n      sica_accuracy_combined: 0.735\n      sc_accuracy_combined: 0.709\n      combined_gap_pp: 2.6\n      c0_folio: 0.52\n      c0_pw: 0.44\n      c0_combined: 0.46\n      bootstrap_p_folio: 0.023\n      bootstrap_p_combined: 0.072\n      bootstrap_p_pw: 0.18\n      tiebreak_win_rate_folio: 0.78\n      tiebreak_win_rate_combined: 0.75\n      n_ties_folio: 41\n      n_ties_pw: 88\n      n_ties_combined: 129\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.031\n      wall_time_h: 12.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      D012 60题已显示 FOLIO gap=+6.7pp, combined gap=+3.3pp, C0=53.3%。扩展到 804题时：\n      (1) FOLIO gap 从6.7pp 略回归到6.9pp——204题样本更大更稳定，D012的10题FOLIO偏乐观但大方向对，\n      因为 FOLIO 的 NLI 三分类答案空间天然产生 tie（K=12偶数），SICA 的 MaxSAT 在 tie 上胜率~78%；\n      (2) PW gap 收窄到+1.2pp——PW 是二分类（True/False），tie 频率低于 FOLIO 的三分类，\n      且 PW D5 难度较均匀导致 SC 已经较强，SICA 增益空间有限；\n      (3) Combined gap=+2.6pp 因 PW 占 75% 样本被稀释但仍 >2pp；\n      (4) Bootstrap p_folio=0.023 因 n=204 提供充足统计功效（d012 的 n=10 太小），\n      p_combined=0.072 在 p<0.10 阈值内但因 PW 的低信号稀释不够强；\n      (5) C0 保持在 0.46 附近——14B-Instruct 在 T=0.7 下对逻辑推理任务天然产生多样输出，\n      不像 reasoning model 那样收敛，且 K=12 给予足够采样充分暴露多答案路径。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 14B expanded row (FOLIO 82.4 vs 75.5, PW 70.5 vs 69.3, Combined 73.5 vs 70.9)\"\n      - \"T2: Tiebreak Comparison — expanded data (SICA 78% vs random 50% vs alphabetical ~55% on 129 ties)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.46, gap=+2.6pp) for 14B-expanded, with error bars from bootstrap CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      FOLIO 是主力战场——三分类 NLI 天然高 tie 率让 SICA 的 principled tiebreaking 优势最大化。\n      PW 贡献弱但不拖后腿。p<0.05 on FOLIO 是 Claim 1 的统计支撑锚点。\n      Combined p<0.10 足够让 reviewer 接受\"方向性显著\"。\n\n  - name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      K sensitivity (K=6,8,12,16,20) on D012's 60 questions. 测试 tiebreak 频率与 K 的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      K6_sica_acc: 0.717\n      K6_sc_acc: 0.700\n      K6_gap_pp: 1.7\n      K6_c0: 0.40\n      K6_tie_rate: 0.15\n      K8_sica_acc: 0.733\n      K8_sc_acc: 0.700\n      K8_gap_pp: 3.3\n      K8_c0: 0.47\n      K8_tie_rate: 0.20\n      K12_sica_acc: 0.733\n      K12_sc_acc: 0.700\n      K12_gap_pp: 3.3\n      K12_c0: 0.53\n      K12_tie_rate: 0.25\n      K16_sica_acc: 0.750\n      K16_sc_acc: 0.717\n      K16_gap_pp: 3.3\n      K16_c0: 0.57\n      K16_tie_rate: 0.22\n      K20_sica_acc: 0.750\n      K20_sc_acc: 0.733\n      K20_gap_pp: 1.7\n      K20_c0: 0.58\n      K20_tie_rate: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0 随 K 单调递增——更多采样暴露更多 reasoning path，从 K=6 的 0.40 升到 K=20 的 0.58，\n      但增速递减（marginal path discovery 下降）；\n      (2) Tie rate 呈倒 U 形——K=6 时偶数但候选少 tie 少，K=12 处 tie 最多（三分类 4:4:4 分裂概率最高），\n      K=16/20 时多数更容易形成所以 tie 反而下降；\n      (3) Gap 在 K=8-16 稳定在 ~3.3pp，说明 SICA 增益不是 K 特定值的 artifact；\n      (4) K=6 gap 缩小到 1.7pp 因 tie 太少 SICA 无处发力；\n      (5) K=20 gap 也缩小因更多采样让 SC 本身更稳定（大数定律），tie 减少，\n      但 SC 准确率也上升说明 SC 和 SICA 都受益于更多采样只是 marginal SICA gain 递减。\n      K=12 是 sweet spot——足够多样性产生 tie，又不至于太多采样消除分歧。\n    tables:\n      - \"T3: K Sensitivity — 5 rows showing K vs C0 vs gap vs tie_rate\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F4: K curve — dual Y-axis, left: accuracy (SICA vs SC lines), right: C0 and tie_rate\"\n    analysis: >\n      K=12 作为默认值有合理性。关键 insight 是 gap 在 K=8-16 稳定——\n      SICA 不依赖于精确的 K 选择。F4 图支撑\"robust to hyperparameter\"叙事。\n\n  - name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      在 exp-001 的 804 题扩展数据上重新运行 SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic vs SC-first-seen。\n      CPU-only reanalysis。\n    expected_results:\n      n_ties_total: 129\n      sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.77\n      sc_random_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.50\n      sc_alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.53\n      sc_first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.47\n      sica_vs_random_delta_pp: 27.0\n      sica_vs_alphabetical_delta_pp: 24.0\n      n_ties_folio: 41\n      n_ties_pw: 88\n      sica_tiebreak_acc_folio: 0.80\n      sica_tiebreak_acc_pw: 0.75\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) D012 小样本已显示 SICA tiebreak 80% (4/5)，扩展到 129 ties 后回归到 77%——\n      部分 tie 中约束提取质量不够好导致 MaxSAT 选错，但大部分 tie SICA 的 weighted constraint\n      aggregation 确实选出了更一致的答案；\n      (2) Random 理论值 33-50%（取决于 tie 中候选数），实测约 50% 因多数 tie 是 2-way；\n      (3) Alphabetical 略高于 random (53%) 因 FOLIO 答案空间 {True, False, Unknown} 中\n      'False' 排首位而 False 在 NLI 中确实是常见正确答案（否定推理题比例高）——这是个 artifact；\n      (4) First-seen 略低于 random (47%) 因早期采样路径偏向 less-explored reasoning paths；\n      (5) SICA 在 FOLIO ties 上胜率更高 (80%) 因 FOL 约束在逻辑域提取质量最好，\n      PW ties 上略低 (75%) 因 PW 的 closed-world assumption 偶尔与 LLM 的 open-world reasoning 冲突。\n    tables:\n      - \"T2: Tiebreak Comparison (expanded) — 4 methods × overall/FOLIO/PW\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      SICA tiebreak 77% vs random 50% 是 Claim 1 的最直接证据。\n      差距足够大（+27pp on ties）让 reviewer 无法用\"random tiebreak closes the gap\"反驳。\n\n  - name: sica_7b_scaling\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      测试 weaker model → higher C0 → larger SICA gain。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.683\n      sc_accuracy: 0.617\n      gap_pp: 6.7\n      c0: 0.65\n      bootstrap_p: 0.12\n      folio_sica: 0.733\n      folio_sc: 0.633\n      folio_gap_pp: 10.0\n      pw_sica: 0.650\n      pw_sc: 0.604\n      pw_gap_pp: 4.6\n      n_ties: 21\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.81\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.045\n      wall_time_min: 35\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.65 显著高于 14B 的 0.53——7B 模型能力较弱，对逻辑推理任务的\"信心\"更低，\n      同一问题上更容易产生不同推理路径和不同答案，T=0.7 下 diversity 更高；\n      (2) SC 准确率下降到 61.7%（14B 为 70%）因模型基础能力弱，但 SICA gap 扩大到 +6.7pp\n      因高 C0 意味着更多 tie 和更多 SICA 可以介入的机会；\n      (3) FOLIO gap 高达 +10pp——三分类 + 高 C0 双重放大 tiebreak 优势；\n      (4) Tiebreak 胜率 81% 略高于 14B 的 78%——7B 的错误推理链产生的约束质量虽然绝对值低，\n      但正确链和错误链之间的约束满足度差异反而更大（正确答案的约束更 internally consistent），\n      MaxSAT 更容易区分；\n      (5) Bootstrap p=0.12 因 n=60 太小，但方向性明确——扩展数据后预计 p<0.05；\n      (6) Exclusion rate 略高 (4.5% vs 14B 2.6%) 因 7B 产生更多低质量约束被 MaxSAT 排除。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 7B row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.65, gap=+6.7pp) — 高于 14B 点，支撑 monotonic trend\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: 7B column showing high-C0 / high-gap regime\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B 是 C0-vs-gap monotonic trend 的关键高端数据点。C0=0.65 >> 14B 的 0.46(expanded)\n      且 gap 更大，完美验证 \"weaker model → more diversity → more SICA value\"。\n      Combined with 72B 和 QwQ 数据形成完整 scaling story。\n\n  - name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      QwQ-32B 已有数据 formatted for Operating Regime Analysis section。\n      Data from MVP phase (AIME 22题, PW 16题, FOLIO 10题)。\n    expected_results:\n      c0_aime: 0.0\n      c0_pw: 0.1875\n      c0_folio: 0.0\n      c0_combined: 0.036\n      sica_sc_gap_pp_aime: 0.0\n      sica_sc_gap_pp_pw: 0.0\n      sica_sc_gap_pp_folio: 0.0\n      sica_sc_gap_combined: 0.0\n      n_total: 48\n      regime: degenerate\n      regime_explanation: \"C0<5% → SICA≡SC structurally\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) QwQ-32B 是 reasoning model，内置 chain-of-thought 极长且高度确定性——\n      即使 T=0.7 采样，reasoning chain 的内在逻辑锁定导致最终答案几乎完全一致；\n      (2) AIME C0=0% 因数学域答案唯一且 QwQ 准确率高（~73%），不同采样路径殊途同归；\n      (3) PW C0=18.75% 是唯一非零值——PW 的 closed-world reasoning 有歧义性，\n      少数问题上 QwQ 的推理链出现分歧，但仍远低于 14B-Instruct 的 50%；\n      (4) FOLIO C0=0% 因 QwQ 在 NLI 上也高度自洽；\n      (5) Combined C0=3.6% 远低于 20% threshold → SICA 完全退化为 SC，\n      zero ties → zero tiebreak opportunities → gap=0pp across all domains。\n      这不是 SICA 失败，是 operating regime 边界的 clean demonstration。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — QwQ-32B row (all deltas = 0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.036, gap=0.0) — 紧贴原点，与 instruction models 形成鲜明对比\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: QwQ column showing degenerate regime (C0<5%, gap=0)\"\n    analysis: >\n      QwQ 数据是 negative result 但叙事价值极高——证明 SICA 不是 universally applicable，\n      而是 regime-dependent。Reviewer concern \"why not just use reasoning model\" 的答案：\n      reasoning model 不需要 SICA（已经 self-consistent），instruction model 需要且受益。\n\n  - name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      CPU-only analysis: plot C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models and K values。\n      汇总 exp-001/002/004/005/007/010/011/014 数据。\n    expected_results:\n      n_data_points: 14\n      pearson_r: 0.91\n      spearman_rho: 0.88\n      c0_threshold_for_positive_gap: 0.20\n      linear_fit_slope: 0.12\n      linear_fit_intercept: -2.1\n      r_squared: 0.83\n      models_in_scatter:\n        - \"7B (C0=0.65, gap=+6.7)\"\n        - \"14B-expanded (C0=0.46, gap=+2.6)\"\n        - \"72B-AWQ (C0=0.25, gap=+1.0)\"\n        - \"Mistral-7B (C0=0.42, gap=+4.5)\"\n        - \"LLaMA-8B (C0=0.40, gap=+3.8)\"\n        - \"QwQ-32B (C0=0.036, gap=0.0)\"\n        - \"DeepSeek-R1 (C0=0.03, gap=0.0)\"\n        - \"14B K=6 (C0=0.40, gap=+1.7)\"\n        - \"14B K=8 (C0=0.47, gap=+3.3)\"\n        - \"14B K=16 (C0=0.57, gap=+3.3)\"\n        - \"14B K=20 (C0=0.58, gap=+1.7)\"\n      c0_20_binary_classifier_accuracy: 1.0\n      regime_boundary_clean: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) Pearson r=0.91 因 best tier 下所有实验结果都落在预期范围内——高 C0 模型确实产生高 gap，\n      低 C0 模型确实 gap≈0，中间有 smooth gradient；\n      (2) 14 个数据点来自 7 个模型配置 + 5 个 K 值变体 + 2 个 reasoning model，\n      覆盖 C0 从 0.03 到 0.65 的完整 range；\n      (3) C0=0.20 是 clean threshold——所有 C0>0.20 的配置 gap>0，所有 C0<0.20 的 gap≈0，\n      binary classifier accuracy=100%；\n      (4) Slope=0.12 意味着 C0 每增加 10pp SICA gap 增加约 1.2pp——\n      这个关系的物理含义是更多 diversity → 更多 ties → 更多 SICA 纠正机会；\n      (5) R²=0.83 而非 1.0 因 K ablation 数据引入噪声（K=20 gap 回落但 C0 继续升），\n      但仍然是 strong linear trend；\n      (6) Spearman rho=0.88 略低于 Pearson 因 reasoning model 数据点在角落聚集产生 rank tie。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        F2 (Hero Figure): C0-vs-gap scatter plot. X-axis: C0 (0-0.7), Y-axis: SICA-SC gap (pp).\n        Color: model family (Qwen=blue, Mistral=orange, LLaMA=green, reasoning=red).\n        Shape: circle=instruction, triangle=reasoning.\n        Dashed vertical line at C0=0.20 marking regime boundary.\n        Linear fit line with r²=0.83 shown.\n        Shaded region: \"SICA Operating Regime\" for C0>0.20.\n        Key visual: 7B/Mistral/LLaMA cluster in upper-right, 14B in middle, 72B in lower-middle,\n        QwQ+DeepSeek pinned to origin.\n      - >\n        F3: Operating Regime Heatmap. Rows: models (7B, 14B, 72B, Mistral, LLaMA, QwQ, DeepSeek).\n        Columns: domains (FOLIO, PW, GSM8K if available).\n        Cell color: green (C0>0.30, SICA wins), yellow (0.15<C0<0.30, marginal), red (C0<0.10, degenerate).\n        Clean block structure: instruction models green, reasoning models red.\n    analysis: >\n      Hero figure 是论文的 visual thesis statement。R=0.91 的 C0-gap correlation\n      直接支撑 Claim 3 (C0 as practical diagnostic)。Clean threshold at 0.20 让\n      practitioner 可以用 1 次 SC run 的 C0 决定是否部署 SICA——零额外成本。\n      3 family + 2 reasoning architecture coverage 消灭\"family-specific\"攻击。\n\n  - name: sica_72b_awq\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Within-Qwen scaling 高端数据点。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.817\n      sc_accuracy: 0.800\n      gap_pp: 1.7\n      c0: 0.25\n      bootstrap_p: 0.35\n      folio_sica: 0.867\n      folio_sc: 0.833\n      folio_gap_pp: 3.3\n      pw_sica: 0.783\n      pw_sc: 0.775\n      pw_gap_pp: 0.8\n      n_ties: 8\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.75\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.018\n      wall_time_min: 90\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.25 远低于 14B 的 0.53 和 7B 的 0.65——72B 模型能力强，\n      T=0.7 下大多数问题的 12 条采样路径收敛到同一答案，只有最难的题目才出现分歧；\n      (2) SC 准确率 80% 远高于 14B 的 70%——更强的 base model 意味着更高的 ceiling，\n      但这也压缩了 SICA 的改进空间；\n      (3) Gap=+1.7pp 小于 14B 的 +3.3pp——tie 少（8 vs 14B 的 ~16），SICA 介入机会有限，\n      但 tiebreak 胜率仍然 75% 说明 mechanism 有效只是 opportunity 少；\n      (4) FOLIO gap +3.3pp 仍然可观因三分类 tie 概率高于二分类，\n      但 PW gap 几乎消失 (+0.8pp) 因 72B 在 PW 上太强几乎不产生分歧；\n      (5) Bootstrap p=0.35 不显著因 n=60 + low tie count，\n      但这恰好支撑叙事：\"强模型不需要 SICA\"——这是 feature 不是 bug；\n      (6) AWQ 4-bit 量化可能引入微小 noise 增加 C0（相比 FP16 的 72B），\n      但 effect size <2pp，不影响大方向。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 72B-AWQ row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.25, gap=+1.7pp) — 14B 和 QwQ 之间的 bridge point\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B 是 monotonic trend 的关键中间点：7B(0.65, +6.7) > 14B(0.46, +2.6) > 72B(0.25, +1.7) > QwQ(0.04, 0)。\n      完美支撑 \"C0 (reflecting model confidence) determines SICA value\"。\n      虽然 gap 不显著，但在 scatter plot 中的位置 exactly right。\n\n  - name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      Qualitative analysis on 5-10 representative questions from exp-001.\n      检查约束语义质量。\n    expected_results:\n      n_cases: 8\n      semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.85\n      excluded_constraints_are_errors_rate: 0.75\n      case_categories:\n        correct_constraint_correct_answer: 3\n        correct_constraint_wrong_sc_right_sica: 2\n        noisy_constraint_sica_robust: 2\n        bad_constraint_sica_wrong: 1\n      representative_folio_case: >\n        Problem: \"All managers are employees. John is a manager. Is John an employee?\"\n        Trace 1 (correct): extracts ∀x(Manager(x)→Employee(x)), Manager(John) → concludes True\n        Trace 2 (wrong): extracts Manager(John) but misses universal → concludes Unknown\n        MaxSAT: 2 constraints support True, 1 supports Unknown, True wins with higher satisfaction\n      representative_failure_case: >\n        Problem with ambiguous negation: constraint extraction maps \"not all\" incorrectly\n        to ∀x(¬P(x)), leading MaxSAT to select wrong answer\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) 85% semantically meaningful 因 Qwen2.5-14B 的 FOL extraction 能力在 FOLIO 域表现良好——\n      FOLIO 本身是 FOL 标注数据集，问题结构与 LLM 的 FOL 生成训练数据高度匹配；\n      (2) 75% excluded constraints correspond to errors 因 MaxSAT 的 weighted optimization\n      自然地给予 inconsistent constraints 低权重/排除，而 inconsistency 通常来自推理错误；\n      (3) 2/8 cases 展示 SICA 翻转 SC 错误答案——这是 paper 中最有 narrative power 的案例，\n      reviewer 能直观看到 MaxSAT 如何\"看穿\"错误推理链；\n      (4) 1/8 failure case 保持诚实——negation scope ambiguity 是已知的 FOL extraction 弱点，\n      inclusion 增加 credibility。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Figure: 2-3 annotated case study boxes showing constraint extraction → MaxSAT → answer selection pipeline on specific examples\"\n    analysis: >\n      Case studies 支撑 mechanistic understanding——reviewer 需要看到 SICA 不是 black box。\n      Failure case 的 inclusion 是 strategic transparency，预防\"cherry-picking\"攻击。\n\n  - name: overhead_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      Wall-time breakdown per question from exp-001 data。\n      Address \"is the overhead worth it\" concern。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_total_time_per_question_s: 58.0\n      avg_generation_time_s: 42.0\n      avg_constraint_extraction_time_s: 12.5\n      avg_maxsat_solving_time_s: 0.8\n      avg_answer_aggregation_time_s: 2.7\n      generation_fraction: 0.724\n      constraint_extraction_fraction: 0.216\n      maxsat_fraction: 0.014\n      overhead_fraction: 0.276\n      overhead_vs_sc_multiplier: 1.38\n      marginal_cost_per_pp_gain_s: 6.2\n      constraint_extraction_model: \"same 14B (self-extraction)\"\n      maxsat_solver: \"Z3 PB-MaxSAT\"\n      z3_avg_clauses: 145\n      z3_max_solve_time_ms: 320\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) Generation 占 72.4% 因 K=12 条 trace 是主要耗时——这与 SC 完全相同的成本；\n      (2) Constraint extraction 占 21.6%——用同一个 14B 模型做 FOL 提取，每条 trace 一次 forward pass，\n      但 prompt 短（trace + \"extract FOL constraints\"）所以比 generation 快得多；\n      (3) MaxSAT solving 仅占 1.4%——Z3 对 ~145 clauses 的 PB-MaxSAT 平均 <1s，\n      这是 polynomial-time 的 weighted MAX-SAT 不是 NP-hard 的 unweighted 版本；\n      (4) 总 overhead 仅 1.38x SC——generation 成本不变，额外成本全在 extraction，\n      对比 +2.6pp combined gain 这是 acceptable overhead；\n      (5) Marginal cost = 6.2s per pp gain——reviewer 关心的是\"多花的时间值不值\"，\n      这个数字说明每额外一个百分点准确率只需 ~6s 额外计算。\n    tables:\n      - \"T4: Overhead Breakdown — generation/extraction/MaxSAT/total, with fraction and comparison to SC\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart (appendix): time breakdown per stage, colored by generation (grey) / extraction (blue) / MaxSAT (orange)\"\n    analysis: >\n      1.38x overhead 是 strong selling point——不到 40% 额外成本换 2.6pp gain。\n      MaxSAT 1.4% 直接回应\"over-engineering\"concern：solver 本身几乎免费，\n      成本在 extraction 而非 satisfiability checking。\n\n  - name: sica_mistral_7b\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Cross-family validation #1。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.667\n      sc_accuracy: 0.617\n      gap_pp: 5.0\n      c0: 0.42\n      bootstrap_p: 0.17\n      folio_sica: 0.733\n      folio_sc: 0.633\n      folio_gap_pp: 10.0\n      pw_sica: 0.625\n      pw_sc: 0.604\n      pw_gap_pp: 2.1\n      n_ties: 14\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.79\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.038\n      sica_ge_sc: true\n      wall_time_min: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.42 在 [0.30, 0.55] 范围内——Mistral-7B 能力与 Qwen-7B 相近但略弱于 Qwen-14B，\n      在 T=0.7 下产生的 trace diversity 处于中等水平，高于 C0>25% threshold；\n      (2) SC 准确率 61.7% 低于 Qwen-14B 的 70% 但高于纯猜——Mistral-7B 在逻辑推理上\n      不如 Qwen-14B 但仍有一定能力，FOLIO 上更好因 Mistral 的 instruction following 较强；\n      (3) Gap=+5.0pp 高于 14B 的 +3.3pp——C0 更高 + SC baseline 更低 = 更大改进空间，\n      SICA 在更多 tie 中介入且 correctness margin 更大；\n      (4) FOLIO gap +10pp 非常强——三分类 + 中等 C0 + Mistral 在 NLI 上的 inconsistency\n      给 SICA 大量 tiebreak opportunity；\n      (5) Bootstrap p=0.17 因 n=60 不足，但 cross-family replication 的价值不在于单独 significance\n      而在于 pattern consistency——C0>25% 且 SICA≥SC，与 Qwen 家族 pattern 一致；\n      (6) Tiebreak 胜率 79% 与 14B 的 78% 几乎相同——说明 MaxSAT mechanism\n      不是 Qwen-specific（不同 extraction 质量但 relative ranking 仍然有效）。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — Mistral-7B row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.42, gap=+5.0pp) — 落在 trend line 上，non-Qwen validation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-family replication 成功。C0=0.42 且 SICA≥SC 消除\"Qwen-specific\"攻击。\n      如果 p>0.2 但 pattern consistent，在 3-family scatter 中仍然是 strong evidence。\n\n  - name: sica_llama_8b\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Cross-family validation #2。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.650\n      sc_accuracy: 0.600\n      gap_pp: 5.0\n      c0: 0.40\n      bootstrap_p: 0.19\n      folio_sica: 0.700\n      folio_sc: 0.600\n      folio_gap_pp: 10.0\n      pw_sica: 0.617\n      pw_sc: 0.600\n      pw_gap_pp: 1.7\n      n_ties: 13\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.77\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.042\n      sica_ge_sc: true\n      wall_time_min: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.40 在 [0.30, 0.55] 范围内——LLaMA-8B 与 Mistral-7B 同量级模型，\n      trace diversity 相似但 LLaMA 的 instruction following 在逻辑域略弱导致 C0 略低于 Mistral；\n      (2) SC 准确率 60.0% 是所有 instruction model 中最低——LLaMA-3.1-8B 在 FOLIO/PW\n      的逻辑推理上弱于 Mistral-7B（Meta 的 8B 在 NLI 上不如 Mistral 的专项优化），\n      但 SICA 仍然能够 rescue 一些 tie；\n      (3) Gap=+5.0pp 与 Mistral 一致——C0 相近 (0.40 vs 0.42) 导致 SICA gain 几乎相同，\n      这本身就是 C0-as-predictor 的强力证据（不同 family，相似 C0，相似 gain）；\n      (4) FOLIO gap +10pp 因 LLaMA-8B 在三分类 NLI 上最不稳定，tie 比例最高；\n      (5) Tiebreak 胜率 77% 略低于 Mistral/Qwen——LLaMA 的 FOL extraction quality\n      可能略低因训练数据中 formal logic 比例不如 Qwen/Mistral，\n      但 MaxSAT 的 weighted aggregation 仍然足够 robust；\n      (6) Exclusion rate 4.2% 最高——更多低质量约束被排除，但这恰好说明 MaxSAT\n      的 satisfiability checking 在处理 noisy constraints 时的价值。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — LLaMA-8B row\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.40, gap=+5.0pp) — 与 Mistral 点紧邻，cross-family cluster\"\n    analysis: >\n      3-family validation complete。Mistral 和 LLaMA 的 (C0, gap) 点紧密聚集在 scatter plot 的\n      同一区域——independent family, similar capacity → similar C0 → similar gain。\n      这是 C0 作为 universal predictor（而非 family-specific artifact）的最直接证据。\n\n  - name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Cross-domain C0 测试。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.900\n      sc_accuracy: 0.900\n      gap_pp: 0.0\n      c0: 0.10\n      bootstrap_p: 1.0\n      n_ties: 1\n      tiebreak_win_rate: 0.0\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.015\n      wall_time_min: 20\n      avg_constraints_per_problem: 8.5\n      constraint_extraction_note: \"numeric equality constraints less expressive than FOL\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=0.10 远低于 FOLIO/PW 的 0.46——Qwen2.5-14B 在 GSM8K（小学数学）上准确率极高 (~90%+），\n      12 条采样路径几乎都得到正确数值答案，diversity 极低；\n      (2) SC 准确率 90% 因 14B 对 GSM8K 来说 overqualified——这不是 SICA 失败而是\n      task-relative model confidence 极高的自然结果；\n      (3) Gap=0pp 因 C0=10% < 20% threshold，几乎没有 tie，SICA≡SC；\n      (4) 这个 negative result 极有价值——证明 C0 不只是\"model family\"的函数，\n      而是\"model × task\"交互的函数。同一个 14B 在 FOLIO 上 C0=0.52 在 GSM8K 上 C0=0.10，\n      说明 C0 reflects task-relative difficulty/confidence 而非 model-intrinsic diversity；\n      (5) 约束质量低（avg 8.5 vs FOLIO ~30）——数学域的约束是 numeric equalities\n      而非 FOL predicates，表达力有限且多数 trivially satisfied；\n      (6) 30 题 pilot 足以得出\"C0 low, no gain\"结论，无需扩展。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — 14B-GSM8K row (or appendix)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.10, gap=0.0) — near-origin, same model as (0.46, +2.6) FOLIO point\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: GSM8K column for 14B showing yellow/red (C0 low, no gain)\"\n    analysis: >\n      GSM8K pilot 完美验证\"C0 is task-relative, not model-intrinsic\"。\n      Same model (14B), different tasks → dramatically different C0 and correspondingly different gain。\n      这是 Claim 2/3 的 cross-domain evidence。Paper 叙事：\n      \"C0 captures the interaction between model confidence and task difficulty.\"\n\n  - name: constraint_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      CPU-only ablation on exp-001 data: SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight。\n      测试 MAX-SAT 是否 essential。\n    expected_results:\n      n_total: 804\n      sica_maxsat_accuracy: 0.735\n      sica_countonly_accuracy: 0.718\n      sica_randomweight_accuracy: 0.712\n      sc_accuracy: 0.709\n      maxsat_vs_sc_gap_pp: 2.6\n      countonly_vs_sc_gap_pp: 0.9\n      randomweight_vs_sc_gap_pp: 0.3\n      maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp: 1.7\n      maxsat_vs_randomweight_delta_pp: 2.3\n      tie_subset_n: 129\n      maxsat_tiebreak_acc: 0.77\n      countonly_tiebreak_acc: 0.60\n      randomweight_tiebreak_acc: 0.52\n      folio_maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp: 3.4\n      pw_maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp: 0.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) MaxSAT vs count-only delta=+1.7pp（在 [2.0, 5.0] 范围下限附近但仍有意义）——\n      count-only 仅计算每个答案的支持约束数量，忽略约束之间的 satisfiability 关系，\n      MaxSAT 通过 weighted optimization 考虑约束的 mutual consistency 从而更好地区分正确答案；\n      (2) Count-only 仍然比 SC 好 +0.9pp——说明即使不做 satisfiability checking，\n      constraint count 也提供了比 pure vote count 更细粒度的信号（每个 trace 贡献多个约束 vs 1 票），\n      但 marginal gain 远小于 MaxSAT；\n      (3) Random-weight 几乎等于 SC (+0.3pp)——随机权重破坏了约束的 semantic信号，\n      证明 gain 来自有意义的 constraint weighting 而非简单的 multi-signal aggregation；\n      (4) Tiebreak accuracy 差异最明显：MaxSAT 77% vs count-only 60% vs random 52%——\n      tie 是 MaxSAT 与 count-only 差异最大的场景，因为 tie 意味着 vote count 相同，\n      此时 satisfiability structure 成为唯一 differentiator；\n      (5) FOLIO 上 MaxSAT 优势更大 (+3.4pp vs count-only) 因 FOL 约束的 satisfiability\n      在逻辑域更有意义——约束之间的 logical consistency 直接反映推理正确性；\n      (6) PW 上差异较小 (+0.8pp) 因 binary domain 的约束结构较简单，count 已捕获大部分信号。\n    tables:\n      - \"Appendix Table: Constraint Ablation — 4 methods × FOLIO/PW/Combined\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy of MaxSAT / count-only / random-weight / SC on combined and per-domain\"\n    analysis: >\n      MaxSAT > count-only > random ≈ SC 的 hierarchy 直接支撑 \"satisfiability checking is essential\"。\n      Tiebreak accuracy 差异 (77% vs 60% vs 52%) 是最 compelling 的数字——\n      在 tie 中 MaxSAT 的 structural reasoning 提供了 count-only 无法匹敌的信号。\n      回应\"over-engineering\"attack：MaxSAT solver 成本 <2% total time 但贡献 +1.7pp over count-only。\n\n  - name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。\n      Second reasoning model，LLaMA 底座。\n    expected_results:\n      sica_accuracy: 0.717\n      sc_accuracy: 0.717\n      gap_pp: 0.0\n      c0: 0.033\n      bootstrap_p: 1.0\n      folio_sica: 0.733\n      folio_sc: 0.733\n      folio_gap_pp: 0.0\n      pw_sica: 0.708\n      pw_sc: 0.708\n      pw_gap_pp: 0.0\n      n_ties: 0\n      multi_candidate_problems: 2\n      maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.008\n      wall_time_min: 45\n      regime: degenerate\n    result_rationale: >\n      (1) C0=3.3%（2/60 问题有多答案）在 [0.0, 0.05] 范围内——DeepSeek-R1 虽然是 distilled 到 8B 的\n      小模型，但保留了 reasoning model 的核心特征：extended chain-of-thought 驱动的确定性推理，\n      采样温度 T=0.7 几乎不影响最终答案选择；\n      (2) SC 准确率 71.7% 高于 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 的 60%——R1 distillation 显著提升了\n      推理能力，即使只有 8B 参数也比普通 instruction model 更准确；\n      (3) Gap=0pp 因 C0<5% → SICA≡SC structurally——与 QwQ-32B 的 pattern 完全一致，\n      证明 reasoning model degeneration 不是 Qwen-specific（QwQ 是 Qwen 架构）也不是 size-specific\n      （QwQ 32B vs DeepSeek-R1 8B），而是 reasoning training 的 universal 效应；\n      (4) 仅 2 个问题有多答案且都在 PW 域——与 QwQ 的 pattern 一致（PW 的 closed-world\n      ambiguity 偶尔让 reasoning model 产生分歧，但频率极低）；\n      (5) LLaMA 底座消除\"Qwen 架构归属\"争议——QwQ 和 Qwen-14B 都是 Qwen 架构，\n      reviewer 可能 argue C0 差异来自 architecture 而非 reasoning training；\n      DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B 证明 LLaMA 架构 + reasoning training → low C0，\n      而 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct + no reasoning training → high C0 (0.40)，\n      same architecture, different training → different C0。\n    tables:\n      - \"T1: Main Results — DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B row (all deltas = 0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2 data point: (C0=0.033, gap=0.0) — 与 QwQ 紧邻原点，不同架构 same regime\"\n      - \"F3 heatmap: DeepSeek-R1 row, all red (degenerate)\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek-R1 是 reasoning model degeneration 的 definitive evidence。\n      与 QwQ 配对：2 reasoning architectures (Qwen-based QwQ + LLaMA-based R1),\n      both show C0<5%, both show SICA≡SC。\n      更强的 controlled comparison: LLaMA-8B-Instruct (C0=0.40) vs DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B (C0=0.033)\n      — same base architecture, only difference is reasoning distillation → proves\n      C0 is determined by training regime, not architecture.\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"172f7f56-749b-40ef-a90e-a3bb5aa40d0b","total_cost_usd":0.44449700000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12918,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":13994,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12918,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13994,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12918,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12918},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7879,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.007979,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13994,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12918,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.436518,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c2c3cc44-0e9b-4794-8825-584d65afa5e4"}
